WEBVTT

00:32:28.495 --> 00:32:32.130
CA: Talk about that talk,
because this is another riddle, really.

00:32:32.154 --> 00:32:34.886
I mean, here you are,
you're an introverted person,

00:32:34.910 --> 00:32:36.571
you've got this book coming out,

00:32:36.595 --> 00:32:39.580
you're terrified of public speaking,

00:32:39.604 --> 00:32:42.020
and you know you've got
this book tour coming

00:32:42.044 --> 00:32:43.943
and a TED invitation.

00:32:43.967 --> 00:32:46.162
How did you manage that?

00:32:46.186 --> 00:32:50.372
SC: Yeah. OK, so I was flat-out terrified,

00:32:50.396 --> 00:32:54.144
and I'm now going to give you
the secret to overcoming any fear.

00:32:54.168 --> 00:32:57.455
In this case, it happens to be
the fear of public speaking.

00:32:57.479 --> 00:33:01.051
The answer is that you have to expose
yourself to the thing that you fear,